We decided that we wanted to make a game inspired by DnD.
In order to make it like snakes and ladders without copying the original, we changed the ladders to bridges and change the snakes to dragons to fit the theme. 
Furthermore, we decided to add spaces which would trigger an event. We added Random Encounter spaces which would trigger a dice roll to determine what the player experiences. We also added a Power Up space which would trigger the player to pick up a card to determine what Item they acquire.
For the board design we added differently designed sections like a forest, mountainous area, and a cave that all lead to a kingdom. 
We decided to make different character class types which each have different buffs and debuffs towards certain events within the game. 
We wanted to make the game more engaging by adding more components.
